=== a record the caller does not want is not opened
  returned         (nothing)
  record 1         on disk
  record 2         on disk
  record 3         on disk
  log              (nothing)
=== and one it does want is read, and judged
  returned         one, three
  record 1         on disk
  record 2         gone
  record 3         on disk
  log              err durable queue: unreadable record 00000000000000000002-00000002-1, discarding
=== a record completed between the listing and the read
  returned         one, three
  record 1         on disk
  record 2         gone
  record 3         on disk
  log              (nothing)
=== a record that will not open for some other reason
  returned         one, three
  record 1         on disk
  record 2         on disk
  record 3         on disk
  log              warn durable queue: cannot read record 00000000000000000002-00000002-1: <exn>; leaving
